<title>INDIA: India's Tata Electric 96/97 1st hlf net down.</title>
<headline>India's Tata Electric 96/97 1st hlf net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's power firm Tata Electric Companies said on Thursday its net profit for the six months ended September 30, 1996 fell to 1.7 billion rupees from 2.37 billion rupees during the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Other details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
